  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bashanosaurus\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Bashanosaurus\">Bashanosaurus primitivus</a></i> showing known fossil material of the holotype and referred specimens (which may represent remains of subadult individuals). The exact position of vertebrae and dermal armor is unknown. The ribs are likely from different sides of the body but are shown here on a single side for clarity. Scale bar=50 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(CLGPR V00006-1)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#F89C2A\" title=\"#F89C2A\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(CLGPR V00006-2)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#ED3152\" title=\"#ED3152\"> </b>=Referred <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(CLGPR V00006-3)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1080/02724634.2021.1995737\">\"New stegosaurs from the Middle Jurassic Lower Member of the Shaximiao Formation of Chongqing, China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://naturalhistory.si.edu/sites/default/files/media/translated_publications/Dong%26amp%3B_83.pdf\">\"Dinosaurs from the Jurassic of Sichuan\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0016756806002500\">\"A review of the Late Jurassic stegosaurs (Dinosauria, Stegosauria) from the People's Republic of China\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.skeletaldrawing.com/ornithiscians/huayangosaurus\"><i>Huayangosaurus</i> skeletal</a> by Scott Hartman</li></ul>",
